TateOnProducts -- Computation of parts of the Tate resolution on products
*************************************************************************

Description
===========

This package contains implementations of the algorithm from our paper Tate
Resolutions on Products of Projective Spaces (see
https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.5724 ). It allows computing the direct image
complexes of a coherent sheaf along the projection onto a product of any of the
factors.


The main differences from the paper are:
  * the exterior algebra E is positively graded 
  * we use E instead of omega_E 
  *  all complexes are chain complexes instead of cochain complexes


Beilinson monads
================

  * *note beilinsonWindow: beilinsonWindow, -- extract the subquotient complex
    which contributes to the Beilinson window
  * *note tateResolution: tateResolution, -- compute the Tate resolution
  * *note tateExtension: tateExtension, -- extend the terms in the Beilinson
    window to a part of a corner complex of the corresponding Tate resolution
  * *note beilinson: beilinson, -- apply the beilinson functor
  * *note bgg: bgg, -- make a linear free complex from a module over an
    exterior algebra or a symmetric algebra
  * *note directImageComplex: directImageComplex, -- compute the direct image
    complex
  * *note actionOnDirectImage: actionOnDirectImage, -- recover the module
    structure via a Noether normalization
  * *note composedFunctions: composedFunctions, -- composed functions

