bundle O \oplus O(-1) \oplus O(-2) \oplus O(-3) on P^1, and the sheafification
of M1 (= R^1(\pi \cdot f)_{*} L) is a torsion sheaf on P^1 supported on the
double point at [1:0]. Together with the induced action on S', they have an
O_C-module structure as desired.



