======

Note that the resulting complex is a chain complex instead of a cochain
complex, so that for example HH^i RpiM = HH_{-i} RpiM. Also note that this
requires a pseudo-inverse computation of a split exact sequence, which might
fail over finite fields (see *note SVDComplexes: (SVDComplexes)Top,).

