DummyQuotientBundle -- value for the option BundleType in beilinson
*******************************************************************

Description
===========

The Beilinson bundles U^a will be represented by quotient bundles. On a single
component P^n, U^{-1} (indeed, it is the zero sheaf) is represented as the
cokernel of the Koszul map \oplus^{n+1} S(-2)->S(-1).

