lowerCorner -- compute the lower corner
***************************************

  * Usage: 
        m=lowerCorner(F,d)
  * Inputs:
      * F, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, over the exterior algebra
      * d, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a (multi)-degree
