MapsBetweenFreeBundles -- value for the option BundleType in beilinson
**********************************************************************

Description
===========

This option computes the maps from natural free bundles which generates the
Beilinson bundles U^a to natural free bundles which contains the Beilinson
bundles U^a as subbundles. In other words, this option provides a map between
free modules \wedge^{a+1}W\otimes S(-1)\to \wedge^{a}W\otimes S which factors
through U^a where W=S_1. In particular, it represents a natural embedding of
U^a into the corresponding free bundle.

See also
========

  * *note beilinson: beilinson, -- apply the beilinson functor
  * *note BundleType: BundleType, -- Option in beilinson with values
    PrunedQuotient, QuotientBundle, DummyQuotientBundle, SubBundle, FreeBundle,
    or MapsBetweenFreeBundles
  * *note PrunedQuotient: PrunedQuotient, -- value for the option BundleType in
    beilinson
  * *note QuotientBundle: QuotientBundle, -- value for the option BundleType in
    beilinson
