trivialHomologicalTruncation -- return the trivial truncation of a chain complex
********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        trivialHomologicalTruncation(Complex,d,e)
  * Inputs:
      * C, a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, 
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * e, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, homological indices
  * Outputs:
      * a *note complex: (Complexes)Complex,, 

Description
===========

Given a chain complex

... <- C_{k-1} <- C_k <- C_{k+1} <- ...

return the trivial truncation

0 <- C_d <- C_{d+1} <- ... < C_e <- 0

